# Bun Harness

Harness TypeScript must prefer Bun-native APIs. Host is **bun.com** (not bun.sh).

| Pin | Value | Note |
|-----|-------|------|
| Runtime | Bun **~1.4.0** (`packageManager`) | Source of truth for what exists |
| Types | `@types/bun` / `bun-types` **1.3.14** | Lags runtime — see escape hatch |
| TypeScript | **6.0.3** (`catalog:`) | `"types": ["bun"]` allowlist |

